---
// Example conversation with fictitious data (founder/landing-brief.md, section 1). CSS-only
// sequence; with reduced motion everything is shown at once.
---

<figure class="demo" aria-labelledby="demo-legenda">
  <p class="label" id="demo-legenda">Exemplo com dados fictícios</p>
  <div class="phone">
    <div class="bar">
      <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">JS</span>
      <span>
        <strong>Joana Souza</strong>
        <small>WhatsApp do consultório · mesmo número</small>
      </span>
    </div>
    <ol class="chat">
      <li class="in" style="--d: 0.3s">
        <span class="sr-only">Paciente:</span>
        Oi! Quanto é a avaliação? Tem horário amanhã?
        <time>21:47</time>
      </li>
      <li class="typing" style="--d: 1s" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></li>
      <li class="out" style="--d: 2.1s">
        <b>Assistente</b>
        Oi, Joana! A avaliação custa R$ 180,00 e dura 50 minutos. Amanhã tenho 15:00 ou 17:30. Qual
        fica melhor?
        <time>21:47</time>
      </li>
      <li class="in" style="--d: 3.4s">
        <span class="sr-only">Paciente:</span>
        15h
        <time>21:48</time>
      </li>
      <li class="typing" style="--d: 4s" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></li>
      <li class="out" style="--d: 5.1s">
        <b>Assistente</b>
        Combinado: avaliação amanhã, quinta, às 15:00, com o Dr. Rafael. Te lembro um dia antes.
        <time>21:48</time>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="cal" aria-label="Google Agenda, quinta-feira">
    <p class="cal-head"><span>Google Agenda</span><span>qui., 26/11</span></p>
    <ol>
      <li><time>14:00</time><span class="busy">Retorno · Paulo</span></li>
      <li>
        <time>15:00</time><span class="booked" style="--d: 5.9s"
          >Avaliação · Joana Souza<small>marcado pelo assistente</small></span
        >
      </li>
      <li><time>16:00</time><span class="free">livre</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .demo {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    justify-self: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
  }
  .label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .phone {
    border: 9px solid #111214;
    border-radius: 40px;
    background: var(--bg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 4px rgb(17 18 20 / 10%),
      0 32px 64px -24px rgb(17 18 20 / 35%);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .phone {
      border-color: #2a2a2f;
    }
  }
  .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    line-height: 18px;
  }
  .bar strong {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .bar small {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .avatar {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chat {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px 12px 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 400px;
    align-content: start;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 21px;
  }
  .chat li {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 8px 12px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-bubble);
  }
  .chat time {
    display: block;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .in {
    justify-self: start;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 6px;
  }
  .out {
    justify-self: end;
    background: var(--jade-soft);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
  }
  .out b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--jade-ink);
  }
  .typing {
    display: none;
  }

  .cal {
    position: relative;
    margin: -56px 12px 0 auto;
    width: min(280px, 86%);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--elevation);
    padding: 12px 14px 8px;
  }
  .cal-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cal-head span + span {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .cal ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .cal li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 17px;
  }
  .cal time {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .busy,
  .booked {
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .busy {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .free {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .booked {
    background: var(--jade-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--jade);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .booked small {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--jade-ink);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .chat {
      min-height: 500px;
    }
    .cal {
      position: absolute;
      left: -120px;
      bottom: -64px;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .chat li,
    .booked {
      animation: rise 520ms var(--ease-out) var(--d) both;
    }
    .typing {
      display: flex;
      gap: 4px;
      justify-self: end;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: var(--jade-soft);
      animation: blip 1.1s linear var(--d) both;
    }
    .typing i {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--jade-ink);
      animation: dot 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .typing i:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.15s;
    }
    .typing i:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }
    .booked {
      animation:
        rise 520ms var(--ease-out) var(--d) both,
        ring 1.4s var(--ease-out) calc(var(--d) + 0.3s) both;
    }
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px) scale(0.98);
    }
  }
  @keyframes blip {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    12%,
    85% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      height: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin-top: -8px;
    }
  }
  @keyframes dot {
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
  }
  @keyframes ring {
    from {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgb(0 163 137 / 45%);
    }
    to {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgb(0 163 137 / 0%);
    }
  }
</style>
